#: ../../adr/template.md:16 542c5f65c83b41f1a5773211d177857f
msgid "Context — Why This Decision Matters"
msgstr "背景 — 为什么这项决策重要"

#: ../../adr/template.md:18 a235b635315b445ca5127a864421e9a5
msgid ""
"[Describe the context and problem statement. Focus on **why** this decision "
"is needed now — what changed, what pressure exists, what happens if we do "
"nothing. The \"what\" is in the Decision section; this section is about the "
"forces driving the choice.]"
msgstr ""
"[描述背景与问题陈述。重点说明**为什么**现在需要做这个决策——发生了什么变化、存在什么压力、如果什么都不做会怎样。「决策」一节写“做什么”；本节写驱动选择的力量。]"

#: ../../adr/template.md:20 7b5895929e8741a39fc0df77cbc81e92
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "问题"

#: ../../adr/template.md:22 68f74cafaf8548d79056b0a190146238
msgid ""
"[Clear statement of the problem being addressed. Explain why it is a problem"
" — not just what is broken, but what impact it has on users, team velocity, "
"reliability, or cost.]"
msgstr "[清晰陈述要解决的问题。说明为什么这是一个问题——不仅写哪里坏了，还要写对用户、团队效率、可靠性或成本的影响。]"

#: ../../adr/template.md:24 95d9cafc1954434098d40284f057b8a4
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: ../../adr/template.md:26 c614ef41eb4447eb954197a1cb2cb29a
msgid "Constraint 1: [e.g., Must work with existing infrastructure]"
msgstr "约束 1：[例如：必须与现有基础设施协同工作]"

#: ../../adr/template.md:27 20bef596154a4df386c10c8d4a92e3b4
msgid "Constraint 2: [e.g., Budget limit of $X]"
msgstr "约束 2：[例如：预算上限为 $X]"

#: ../../adr/template.md:28 afc869a8dda041d3883ad13922e30c98
msgid "Constraint 3: [e.g., Timeline of Y weeks]"
msgstr "约束 3：[例如：时间线为 Y 周]"

