msgid "Details"
msgstr "细节"

#: ../../adr/template.md:50 c478a5c188d0414abb7365b87aa115e4
msgid ""
"[More detailed explanation if needed. Include diagrams, code examples, etc.]"
msgstr "[如有需要，给出更详细的说明。可包含图表、代码示例等。]"

